;      BACK TO 6 ON 2026-09-08. The 25 fps reading was the baseline BEFORE this pass, not after -
;      corrected later. The whole beauty pass was free, so it goes back and the cuts move
;      to lines that actually cost something. Do not attribute frames to these again without a
;      before AND after number.
;      6 -> 4 ON 2026-09-11 for the 30 fps target. This is a FULL-RESOLUTION pass, so by the rule
;      learned from Gen 5 TAA above it is one of the costs dynamic resolution cannot trade away -
;      which makes it worth more now than when it was judged free at a fixed render fraction.
;      4 is the value Nightdive cook for their own quality tier 3 (6 is their Cine tier).
;      First line to put back to 6 if there is headroom after PCSS.
;      BACK TO 6 ON 2026-09-11. It is a GPU pass, and GPU work is free below the render-thread
;      floor. At a render fraction that now climbs toward 100 %, the TAA resolve is still where
;      every pixel on screen comes from, so this remains the best image-quality line in the file.
