;      PCSS first searches the shadow map for how FAR AWAY the blocker is, then sizes the filter
;      from that - so a crate on the floor gets a hard contact edge and the same crate's shadow
;      thrown across a corridor goes soft. That is the single most convincing lighting cue in a
;      game lit by hard point lights in dark rooms, which is why the queue ranked it first for
;      looks and last for affordability.
